      "tag": "METROLOGY // SENSORS",
      "title": "Reflective Optical Linear Encoders",
      "body": "<p>Photolithographic chrome-on-glass scales with a 20-micron pitch are read by infrared VCSEL laser diodes and differential ASIC photodiode arrays, interpolating position down to 78 nanometers.</p>"
